## STANDING LINES
- **PRIOR-WORK CHECK:** above (a READY without a PRIOR WORK section is returned).
- No message to any human; no comment or edit on any PR; no Jira write (this kit names none); never delete (move to `.tools/b1233/quarantine/`); no deploy, no hosted host or database, no image push; **no word added to `DEPLOY.md` or any user-facing or operator text**.
- **Closed lists** (the mutants, the permitted edits of R-g, the rows, the fixtures): each is stated by its PROPERTY first and then "at least these"; any other shape: prove it meets the property or STOP.
- `always-verify-and-check` and `no-skip-on-failure`: a red you cannot explain is a STOP; never skip a failing step.

